    "For neighbors in San Mateo, San Carlos, Belmont, Redwood City, Foster City, Burlingame, and the surrounding communities, that proximity makes a real difference. A tinnitus program benefits from convenient follow-up, and being minutes away removes a common barrier to sticking with the plan.",
